{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788213789501,"sessionID":"ses_fa62a5b39ffevmxUbcy053FMKH","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"edit","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-9e7075e9e03f5ab1","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-153/docs/reference/types/stream.md","newString":"fn conjure(n: Int) -> Stream<Int> = lines | map(n);\n\n0\n```","oldString":"fn conjure(n: Int) -> Stream<Int> = lines | map(n)\n\n0\n```"},"output":"Edit applied successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"diff":"Index: /home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-153/docs/reference/types/stream.md\n===================================================================\n--- /home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-153/docs/reference/types/stream.md\n+++ /home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-153/docs/reference/types/stream.md\n@@ -23,9 +23,9 @@\n - A function cannot conjure a stream: a signature may return `Stream` only if a `Stream`\n   came in through its parameter, so the pipeline stays one chain from source to sink.\n \n ```toylang\n-fn conjure(n: Int) -> Stream<Int> = lines | map(n)\n+fn conjure(n: Int) -> Stream<Int> = lines | map(n);\n \n 0\n ```\n \n","filediff":{"file":"/home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-153/docs/reference/types/stream.md","patch":"Index: /home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-153/docs/reference/types/stream.md\n===================================================================\n--- /home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-153/docs/reference/types/stream.md\n+++ /home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-153/docs/reference/types/stream.md\n@@ -23,9 +23,9 @@\n - A function cannot conjure a stream: a signature may return `Stream` only if a `Stream`\n   came in through its parameter, so the pipeline stays one chain from source to sink.\n \n ```toylang\n-fn conjure(n: Int) -> Stream<Int> = lines | map(n)\n+fn conjure(n: Int) -> Stream<Int> = lines | map(n);\n \n 0\n ```\n \n","additions":1,"deletions":1},"truncated":false},"title":"docs/reference/types/stream.md","time":{"start":1788213789496,"end":1788213789499}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"This fragment's error is at byte 0 (the `conjure` declaration itself) so adding `;` before the fn would shift... wait the error is about `conjure` at byte 0. The fn is `fn conjure(n: Int) -> Stream<Int> = lines | map(n)`. The error is reported at byte 0 (the fn start). Adding `;` after the body doesn't shift byte 0. So the error message stays at byte 0. Good. Let me update the fn body to add `;`.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_059d9001f001qprw1fDj40vYkL","sessionID":"ses_fa62a5b39ffevmxUbcy053FMKH","messageID":"msg_059d8f6500017C0kxVYBw7NiWq"}}
