{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788213794418,"sessionID":"ses_fa62a5b39ffevmxUbcy053FMKH","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"edit","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-8c51f82883aa3cfb","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-153/docs/reference/types/result.md","newString":"fn safe_div(pair: {a: Int, b: Int}) -> Result<Int, Str> =\n    ok(pair.a / pair.b) if pair.b != 0 else err(\"division by zero\");\n\n{good: safe_div({a: 10, b: 2}), bad: safe_div({a: 10, b: 0})}","oldString":"fn safe_div(pair: {a: Int, b: Int}) -> Result<Int, Str> =\n    ok(pair.a / pair.b) if pair.b != 0 else err(\"division by zero\")\n\n{good: safe_div({a: 10, b: 2}), bad: safe_div({a: 10, b: 0})}"},"output":"Edit applied successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"diff":"Index: /home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-153/docs/reference/types/result.md\n===================================================================\n--- /home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-153/docs/reference/types/result.md\n+++ /home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-153/docs/reference/types/result.md\n@@ -7,9 +7,9 @@\n the single-key wrapper rather than collapsing one side to `null`.\n \n ```toylang\n fn safe_div(pair: {a: Int, b: Int}) -> Result<Int, Str> =\n-    ok(pair.a / pair.b) if pair.b != 0 else err(\"division by zero\")\n+    ok(pair.a / pair.b) if pair.b != 0 else err(\"division by zero\");\n \n {good: safe_div({a: 10, b: 2}), bad: safe_div({a: 10, b: 0})}\n ```\n \n","filediff":{"file":"/home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-153/docs/reference/types/result.md","patch":"Index: /home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-153/docs/reference/types/result.md\n===================================================================\n--- /home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-153/docs/reference/types/result.md\n+++ /home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-153/docs/reference/types/result.md\n@@ -7,9 +7,9 @@\n the single-key wrapper rather than collapsing one side to `null`.\n \n ```toylang\n fn safe_div(pair: {a: Int, b: Int}) -> Result<Int, Str> =\n-    ok(pair.a / pair.b) if pair.b != 0 else err(\"division by zero\")\n+    ok(pair.a / pair.b) if pair.b != 0 else err(\"division by zero\");\n \n {good: safe_div({a: 10, b: 2}), bad: safe_div({a: 10, b: 0})}\n ```\n \n","additions":1,"deletions":1},"truncated":false},"title":"docs/reference/types/result.md","time":{"start":1788213794413,"end":1788213794416}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"This fragment: fn safe_div body spans lines 11-12, ending with `err(\"division by zero\")` on line 12. Need `;` after line 12. It has an output fence (no error), so no byte offset to worry about.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_059d91037001sG09XY9jf2V0NU","sessionID":"ses_fa62a5b39ffevmxUbcy053FMKH","messageID":"msg_059d907cd0012V7hqBvMWNv91I"}}
