est docs` to see failures. But better to run all tests to find everything. Given the build is cached, let me run the full check but with no-fail-fast to gather all failures. Let me check how `just check` invokes it — it's `cargo nextest run`. Let me run `cargo nextest run --no-fail-fast` and capture output to a file, then read it. But capturing to file uses redirection `>` which is denied. Instead, let me just run and tail.\n\nLet me run the docs test specifically first since it's the biggest new area.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_059db2e5700177MMIBRLfkBarK","sessionID":"ses_fa62a5b39ffevmxUbcy053FMKH","messageID":"msg_059daf6f9001hvNAIJBx4ZwN70"}}
